* unbounded_lp - LP via one diagonal block of size 2 (block_size = -2): max x_1 s.t. x_2 = 1, x >= 0
* PRIMAL UNBOUNDED (== dual infeasible): only x_2 is pinned; x_1 >= 0 is free to grow,
*   so the objective max x_1 is +infinity. Exercises the diagonal (LP) cone path.
* Recession ray xhat = (1,0): A_1 . xhat = 0 (A_1 pins x_2), c . xhat = 1 > 0, xhat >= 0.
